{{!
    @template tool_vae/fiche_preview

    The preview of an import of records from an export of France compétences: where the export comes from, its dates, the
    warnings, a word to check, the table of the records, "nothing to import" when nothing is ready, the provenance, the
    note on the records already imported, and that a record is open to declarations at once.

    Every text comes from the context, worded by tool_vae\output\fiche_preview. The template holds no logic. The texts are
    escaped (double braces). Two keys are HTML (triple braces): tablehtml, the table drawn by the template tool_vae/table
    (its cells by tool_vae/fiche_cell); provenancehtml, a sentence of the language file whose link is drawn by the template
    tool_vae/cell_content and whose other parameters are escaped by tool_vae\output\fiche_preview.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * source - string, where the export comes from
    * dates - string, the day of the export and the day of its files
    * warnings - array of objects {text}: the warnings
    * check - string, the word to check the titles
    * tablehtml - HTML, the table of the records
    * none - false, or an object {text}: nothing can be imported
    * provenancehtml - HTML, the sentence of the provenance
    * gonenote - false, or an object {text}: the note on the records already imported
    * visible - string, the record is open to declarations at once

    Example context (json):
    {
        "source": "Uploaded file: export-fiches-csv-2026-10-19.zip (9.3 MB).",
        "dates": "Export of Monday 19 October 2026. The files are dated Sunday 18 October 2026.",
        "warnings": [{"text": "The number RNCP99001 was typed several times."}],
        "check": "Read the titles before importing.",
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tr><td>RNCP99001</td></tr></table>",
        "none": {"text": "Nothing can be imported."},
        "provenancehtml": "Source: <a href=\"https://www.data.gouv.fr/\">data.gouv.fr</a>, France compétences.",
        "gonenote": {"text": "A competency gone from the export stays."},
        "visible": "An imported record is open to declarations at once."
    }
}}
<p>{{source}}</p>
<p>{{dates}}</p>
{{#warnings}}
<div class="alert alert-warning">{{text}}</div>
{{/warnings}}
<div class="alert alert-info">{{check}}</div>
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{#none}}
<div class="alert alert-danger">{{text}}</div>
{{/none}}
<p class="small">{{{provenancehtml}}}</p>
{{#gonenote}}
<p class="small">{{text}}</p>
{{/gonenote}}
<p class="small">{{visible}}</p>
